From 1a89437c40b77b033a8a4dd965379985dca08c51 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arnon Kaufman <akaufman@habana.ai>
Date: Wed, 25 Oct 2023 16:29:07 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] move zephyr-fwl -> zephyr-agent-fwl

Change-Id: Ic953846ddf7ac10f5a88bcede96bb701270f0780
Signed-off-by: Arnon Kaufman <akaufman@habana.ai>
